                            <h6 class="text-white"><i class="bi bi-stars me-2"></i>Aurora Backgrounds</h6>
                            <p class="text-white-75 mb-0">Dynamic gradient animations creating immersive visual experiences.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="ui-example mb-3 p-3 bg-light rounded spotlight-card">
                            <h6><i class="bi bi-magic me-2"></i>Interactive Elements</h6>
                            <p class="mb-0">Hover effects, magnetic buttons, and smooth transitions enhance user engagement.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h6>Technical Implementation:</h6>
                    <ul>
                        <li>CSS3 backdrop-filter for glass effects</li>
